      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm posting this topic out of frustration for the recent unnecessary degradations in UX, whether it's the removal of \"View Reports\" button from Quick Menu (requiring to interact with the API directly in browser and look at prettified JSON outputs) or the nameplate changes that came with this beta `Build 1878`.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-23T18:41:02.478Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It's bad user experience to have to go to a special purpose world to input an URL to fetch an image for an icon, place a camera in a position, and take a photo to upload an icon without VRC+. Let everyone upload icons directly, or don't.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202623-openbeta#features\n\n> To that end, you'll notice the User Profile Icon is now always visible. That's because it's no longer a VRC+ feature -- now everyone can have an icon. For now, those without VRC+ will be limited to using the in-game camera to create an icon.",
